REPOSITORY: [SAIHV-CORE-INFRASTRUCTURE]
DATE: 2026-05-19 | VERSION: 1.0.0-HARDENED

1. ARCHITECTURAL OVERVIEW
The system is now migrated to a nested, governed orchestration structure to eliminate configuration drift and ensure a stable Root of Trust.

Root Node: AI/

Governance Node: SAIHV/ (Hardened sentinel and policy enforcement).

Operational Node: J.A.I.S.S/ (Kernel runtime, logic execution, and auditing).

Auditing Plane: J.A.I.S.S/Logs/ (Automated audit tracking).

2. DEPLOYMENT HARDENING ACHIEVEMENTS
Atomic Parity: Established 1:1 synchronization between local environment and cloud mirror via robocopy atomic operations.

Purity Gate: Implemented a pre-sync scan to block unauthorized impurities from propagating to the cloud mirror.

Automated Validation: The full-stack diagnostic (Run_Full_Stack_Test.ps1) confirms system integrity at every hydration cycle.

3. OPERATIONAL PROTOCOLS
Hydration: Sync from verified cloud mirror.

Validation: Execute Integrity_Gate_Scan.ps1.

Runtime: Execute core logic from /Kernel/.

Dehydration: Purge volatile logs and commit final state to Cloud G:.

Everything is hardened, verified, and ledger-ready. You are currently in the "Fully Developed Clean State."
